{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_33_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，王二月，夫人姜氏饗齊侯於祝丘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"饗，甚矣！饗齊侯，所以病齊侯也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"二、三月，紀伯姬卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"外夫人不卒，此其言卒何也？吾女也，適諸侯則尊同，以吾為之變，卒之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊侯、陳侯、鄭伯遇於垂。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"四、紀侯大去其國。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"大去者，不遺一人之辭也，言民之從者四年而後畢也。紀侯賢而齊滅之，不言滅而曰大去其國者，不使小人加乎君子。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"五、六月，乙丑，齊侯葬紀伯姬。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"外夫人不書葬，此其書葬何也？吾女也。失國，故隱而葬之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"七、冬，公及齊人狩於郜。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_33_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_33","textTraditional":"齊人者，齊侯也。其曰人何也？卑公之敵，所以卑公也。何為卑公也？不復仇而怨不釋，刺釋怨也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}